Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Sandstorm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 24
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.23,0:00:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, don’t abandon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.27,0:00:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, don’t leave me behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.39,0:00:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.15,0:00:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t move.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.03,0:00:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,While you were unconscious,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.19,0:00:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy managed to get the antidote for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.63,0:00:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But Wolffy said,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.78,0:01:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,you cannot use your eyes for three days after applying the medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.59,0:01:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, all our efforts will go to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.79,0:01:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.66,0:01:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go; Cha Erlang will likely be tracking us down soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.59,0:01:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Where to?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.63,0:01:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren’t you planning to go somewhere else?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.43,0:01:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re still willing to come with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.98,0:01:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The original deal was that you’d help me get the antidote
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and I would escort you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.91,0:01:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ve done your part, so now it’s my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.47,0:01:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you’d keep your word, Big Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.07,0:01:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But with your eyes in this condition, traveling won’t be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.62,0:01:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be much more convenient to have a vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.58,0:01:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But there isn’t a vehicle in sight here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.64,0:01:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be great if someone just brought a vehicle right to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.91,0:01:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did it have to get stuck at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.39,0:02:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch that con artist!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.78,0:02:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab him—the con artist! Don’t let him get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.82,0:02:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So, that con artist was prescribing random medicines.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.90,0:02:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a good thing you didn’t take his medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.91,0:02:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He actually came to deliver a vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.18,0:02:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s get out of here quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.42,0:02:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m so mad—it’s all because of that fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.98,0:02:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m definitely going to settle the score for that fish incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.82,0:02:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.78,0:02:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We managed to dodge that giant sandshark—that’s an achievement in itself. Let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.86,0:02:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll settle this score later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.97,0:02:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Have the people sent to find Blue Scarf sent back any word?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.62,0:02:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.58,0:02:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, Boss. She doesn’t have the antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.98,0:02:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How far can someone who can’t see really get? We’ll find her sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.05,0:02:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy’s analysis was spot on. Reward him with some nutritious soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.30,0:03:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie, I need you to do something for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.69,0:03:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Secretly take this antidote to the trading post.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.85,0:03:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Post a bounty exactly as written on this paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.97,0:03:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, you absolutely cannot let anyone else find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.97,0:03:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.76,0:03:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So much of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.56,0:03:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, you’ve really served me well these past few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.29,0:03:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ve earned this—drink up to your heart’s content.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.96,0:03:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re all my good friends; let’s eat together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.44,0:03:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, I’ve figured you out, haven’t I?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.95,0:03:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Where did I slip up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.23,0:03:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are loyal and true—the kind of partner worth having.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.84,0:03:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, stop the flattery.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.12,0:03:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, stop the flattery.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.88,0:03:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Drink up, Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.20,0:03:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t let my buddies go hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.67,0:03:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, this soup…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.23,0:03:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You know…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.95,0:04:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was little, my friends back in town and I used to share food too…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.39,0:04:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like you’re doing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.56,0:04:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren’t for that Blue Scarf…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.00,0:04:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What did that Blue Scarf do to you to make you hate her so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.72,0:04:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,She…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.56,0:04:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Report, Boss! We’ve picked up the Blue Scarf’s trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.35,0:04:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, take your positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.83,0:04:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We absolutely cannot let her get away this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.43,0:04:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.34,0:04:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, you’re amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.82,0:04:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve been by Boss’s side longer than you have,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.03,0:04:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,yet I’ve never heard him mention the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.79,0:04:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ve been to this place so many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.75,0:04:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.10,0:04:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How was I supposed to know the desert would be so hard to navigate?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.54,0:04:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should ask someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.54,0:04:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of normal person would be out here in the desert alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.59,0:04:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Look over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.62,0:05:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There really is someone there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.26,0:05:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.42,0:05:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see anyone who looks like us…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.51,0:05:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,driving off in a certain direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.90,0:05:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.14,0:05:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They went that way, yet there’s not a trace of them to be seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.42,0:05:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi, did you find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.26,0:05:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.94,0:05:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.74,0:05:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s clearly a lie; there’s no one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.86,0:05:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There really is someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.06,0:05:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.14,0:05:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,After him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.14,0:05:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Scarf, I’m definitely going to catch you this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.45,0:06:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t rush, don’t rush—safety first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.73,0:06:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Cha Erlang is catching up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.16,0:06:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Brother Weslie!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.20,0:06:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.97,0:06:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn’t that Cha Erlang’s vehicle which the Lord was talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.80,0:06:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Cha Erlang really is chasing Weslie and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.88,0:06:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we have to stop him immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.29,0:06:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.98,0:06:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.51,0:06:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Who blew up my vehicle?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.99,0:06:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It was us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.55,0:06:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Handsome and dashing…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.79,0:07:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Tall and mighty…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.35,0:07:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The Club Brothers, soon to be the stars of the show
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.66,0:07:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who’s talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.74,0:07:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What a waste of such a spectacular entrance
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.63,0:07:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So, it’s just two little runts
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.31,0:07:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi and Sparky
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.38,0:07:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They’re from Guangzong’s crew
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.78,0:07:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he send them to settle the score over the water theft?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.42,0:07:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But they didn’t bring many people
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.30,0:07:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to teach you a lesson
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.15,0:07:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it! How dare you launch a sneak attack
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.95,0:07:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, I’ll go take care of them for you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.42,0:07:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.87,0:07:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Go into action with Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.15,0:07:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No need; to deal with a few insignificant bandits,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.34,0:07:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I can handle it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.14,0:08:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s Wolffy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.78,0:08:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you lot had even a fraction of Wolffy’s drive,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.48,0:08:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,we’d be living the good life by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.27,0:08:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,They actually sent a little squirt out to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.79,0:08:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get ’em, Sparky!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.16,0:08:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.04,0:08:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! I’m Wolffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.47,0:08:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.35,0:08:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Wolffy okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.16,0:08:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He can’t handle this alone—hurry up and provide backup for Wolffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.43,0:08:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.35,0:08:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you were…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.96,0:08:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re going to hit friendly forces!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.16,0:08:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s retreat for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.61,0:08:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did they stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.85,0:08:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a sandstorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.45,0:09:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,A sandstorm is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.77,0:09:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Driver, hurry and pick Wolffy up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.41,0:09:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Where’s Wolffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.00,0:09:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The sandstorm is huge; Wolffy might have been swept away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.61,0:09:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.09,0:09:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.85,0:09:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The sandstorm is coming—hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.60,0:09:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The car is stuck in a pit; it won’t be moving anytime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.56,0:09:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do then?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.47,0:09:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We can’t stay in the car; we need to find somewhere to take shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.66,0:09:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we still on the route I mentioned?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.78,0:09:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.98,0:09:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s get out and walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.10,0:09:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Head south from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.25,0:09:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Not far away…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.25,0:09:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s a place I used to live where we can take shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.97,0:09:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.96,0:10:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.98,0:10:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.18,0:10:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t hold on much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.56,0:10:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness there’s a cave here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.71,0:10:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.19,0:10:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Wolffy; I can prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.31,0:10:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Paddi always hides cookies in his textbooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.44,0:10:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, Sparky—you still get scared by cockroaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.39,0:10:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.19,0:11:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe you’re Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.38,0:11:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, you wouldn’t have come back to save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.82,0:11:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But why have you turned into this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.22,0:11:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s block the opening first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.47,0:11:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see a glowing house?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.79,0:11:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The sandstorm is too strong; I can’t see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.26,0:11:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My mom says I have naturally good eyesight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.11,0:11:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.46,0:11:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s a light over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.18,0:11:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.77,0:11:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s a door handle here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.73,0:11:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.49,0:11:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s pull together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.74,0:12:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s open.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.90,0:12:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and go in.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
